Z||000005||Xtreme Fiero's||08-21-2000||07:26 PM||||How do I tell if my 4-speed trans is the 4:10 or the 3: whatever trans is ther a RPO code i can look for? or a # on the trans (in car)?||||reg||1
Z||000006||mrfiero||08-21-2000||08:24 PM||||The 4.10 4-sp. was only available on '84 Fieros.  The RPO code is M19.<P>It will bolt up to and work with any Fiero engine (4-cyl. or V-6).<BR> ||||reg||1
